    "message": "Reuse model signatures and stop summing the whole EventLog at each save\n\nA writer computed model_signatures twice per save for configs that do not\nchange, about 10 ms; it now computes them once per configs' canonical JSON.\nThe archive summed the length of every EventLog record only to learn that\nthe world document is over 64 KiB; it now stops at the limit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
